# Build context for hitsai/midataworks-runner is the repository root (it copies backend/src/runner,
# backend/src/runner_contract, the contract package's deps and the packaged contract, plus
# runner/). Everything else is excluded so the image stays small and carries no secret or test.
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.wasm
*.cwasm
.git/
.github/
0xcc/
docs/
frontend/
manual/
k8s/
designer/
datajuicer/
records/
scripts/
PLAN-*.md
backend/tests/
backend/alembic/
backend/.venv/
backend/venv/
runner/tests/
